      "visualHeaderTooltip": [
        {
          "properties": {
            "text": {
              "expr": {
                "Literal": {
                  "Value": "'#: Place by invite score among the artists the page filters leave (1 = best).\nArtist: Spotify artist name; 4 letters of the Spotify ID are added when two artists share a name.\nHot song: The artist''s song that came out after their last NDN visit and isn''t on NDN''s YouTube yet; if several, the one with the most TikTok videos.\nWhat to do: Invite / boost the NDN video of this song / post the band''s clips or film this song.\nOPM top 30 place: The new song''s place in the OPM top 30 (Top 50 PH + Viral Hits PH + Billboard PH Hot 100).\nTikTok videos: Videos on TikTok using the new song''s official sound (sound page, latest weekly count).\nNDN video to boost: NDN''s YouTube video of this song; if none, the band''s most viewed NDN video.\nIts views: Views of that NDN video (latest daily count).\nLast NDN post: Latest NDN post featuring the artist.\nInvite again after: 10 months after the latest NDN visit.\nScore: The nine parts added up with their weights: TikTok 55, Spotify 30, other 15. Each part scores 0-100 against all artists checked (100 = top, 50 = middle, no data = 0). Higher = better to invite now.'"
                }
